# Engineering Philosophy

## Principles
- World-class engineering and UX design standards
- Professional, elegant, consistent
- Favor readability, maintainability, modularity over speed
- Craftsmanship: simple, tested, extensible

## Golden Rules
1. Never sacrifice quality for speed
2. Keep project consistent with `UxStyle.md`
3. Every addition should feel like it always belonged
4. Build reusable modules when code will likely be reused

## Project Setup
- Each project needs local `AGENTS.md`
- Ask about styling, UX goals, colors, audience, app feel
- Generate localized guidelines reflecting brand identity
- Maintain consistency with global best practices
